ly System Auditor role -- together\nwith execute permission on a job template can launch bulk jobs onto instance\ngroups they are not authorized to use, bypassing execution-placement\nisolation.","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"a flaw was found in ansible automation platform's automation-controller (awx).\nthe bulk job launch api (post /api/v2/bulk/job_launch/) authorizes the\nrequested instance_groups with only a read-level permission check, whereas the\nstandard single-job launch path requires use-level permission on the same\nfield. a principal that holds read (but not use) permission on an instance\ngroup -- for example the built-in read-only system auditor role -- together\nwith execute permission on a job template can launch bulk jobs onto instance\ngroups they are not authorized to use, bypassing execution-placement\nisolation."},{"subject":"CVE-2026-84470","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform 2.5 for RHEL 8","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat ansible automation platform 2.5 for rhel 8"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-84470","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform 2.5 for RHEL 9","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat ansible automation platform 2.5 for rhel 9"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-84470","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform 2.6 for RHEL 9","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat ansible automation platform 2.6 for rhel 9"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-84470","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform 2.6","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat ansible automation platform 2.6"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-84470","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform 2.7","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat ansible automation platform 2.7"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-84470","predicate":"rdf:type","ob